{"name":"Reading aloud practice","deep":true,"image":null,"mentions":0,"casual":{"lead":["Reading aloud practice means regularly voicing written text with attention to pacing, enunciation and expression. In voice-improvement discussions it is described as a way to work on cadence and clarity.","No studies or reference articles were found examining it as a looksmaxxing practice, so its effects on perceived attractiveness are untested."],"sections":[{"h":"How it works","paras":["Practitioners describe repeated oral reading as a way to rehearse articulation and pacing in a controlled setting, often combined with recording and playback."],"subs":[]},{"h":"Risks and caveats","paras":["No risks are documented. Prolonged loud speaking can strain the voice, which is general voice-care guidance rather than a finding specific to this practice."],"subs":[]}]},"gallery":[],"links":{"studies":[],"trials":[],"label":null,"reddit":[],"forums":[{"title":"Natty on Pennies","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/natty-on-pennies/223959","site":"T Nation · 1992 posts · 2016"},{"title":"Abused Bulldog: Just a grumpy SOB","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/abused-bulldog-just-a-grumpy-sob/150471","site":"T Nation · 1127 posts · 2011"},{"title":"Alpha's Work II","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/alphas-work-ii/147071","site":"T Nation · 1126 posts · 2010"},{"title":"Catholic Q & A","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/catholic-q-a/158641","site":"T Nation · 1125 posts · 2010"},{"title":"WooWoo Stuff - All Things Woowoo","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/woowoo-stuff-all-things-woowoo/241568","site":"T Nation · 742 posts · 2018"},{"title":"Do You Still Believe in the United States?","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/do-you-still-believe-in-the-united-states/288619","site":"T Nation · 708 posts · 2024"},{"title":"The Bible","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/the-bible/186425","site":"T Nation · 515 posts · 2013"},{"title":"9/11 is NOT a Conspiracy!","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/9-11-is-not-a-conspiracy/126715","site":"T Natio